title: "Stackable Conical Tube Stands"
abstract: >-
  Parametric, stackable single-tube stands for 15 mL and 50 mL conical
  centrifuge tubes (or any conical tube from its dimensions), generated
  by a Python script for FDM 3D printing.
type: software
